title: 'pallet-asset-conversion: add `MutateLiquidity::create_pool_with_fee`'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds `MutateLiquidity::create_pool_with_fee`, which lets runtime code create a pool with its
      own swap fee. Unlike the `create_pool_with_fee` extrinsic, it does not check `AdminOrigin`,
      but the fee is still bounded by `MaxSwapFee`.

      Implementers of `MutateLiquidity` must add the method.
crates:
  - name: pallet-asset-conversion
    bump: major
